Third-party data included in this distribution

1. Secured Overnight Financing Rate (SOFR), monthly averages
   File: examples/sofr-monthly-v1.json
   Source: Federal Reserve Bank of New York, Secured Overnight Financing
   Rate [SOFR], retrieved from FRED, Federal Reserve Bank of St. Louis,
   https://fred.stlouisfed.org/series/SOFR, retrieved 2026-11-03.
   The SOFR data is subject to the Terms of Use posted at newyorkfed.org.
   The New York Fed is not responsible for publication of the SOFR data by
   ALM Studio, does not sanction or endorse any particular republication,
   and has no liability for your use.
   (c) 2026 Federal Reserve Bank of New York. Content from the New York Fed
   subject to the Terms of Use at newyorkfed.org
   (https://www.newyorkfed.org/privacy/termsofuse).
   FRED marks this series "Copyrighted: Citation Required"; the citation
   above is the one FRED suggests.
   Copies of the same series are embedded in replica/inputs/deposit-forms-v1.json,
   replica/inputs/feature-demos-v1.json and replica/inputs/survival-path-v1.json,
   under the same terms; replica/inputs/NOTICE, beside them, carries this
   notice and citation for those files.

2. U.S. Treasury constant-maturity par yields
   Files: packages/kernel/public/market_public.json (the curve nodes only,
   as of 2026-03-31) and packages/kernel/public/rate_history_public.json
   (month-end history, October 2008 to March 2026, series DGS1MO, DGS3MO,
   DGS6MO, DGS1, DGS2, DGS3, DGS5, DGS7, DGS10, DGS20, DGS30).
   Source: Board of Governors of the Federal Reserve System, H.15 Selected
   Interest Rates, constant-maturity Treasury series, retrieved from FRED,
   Federal Reserve Bank of St. Louis.
   The term funding premium and the volatility surfaces in the snapshot,
   and the term-funding series in the history, are constructed illustrative
   values and are not market data.

3. Purchase Only House Price Index for the United States
   File: apps/server/data/macro/HPIPONM226S.csv
   Citation: U.S. Federal Housing Finance Agency, Purchase Only House Price
   Index for the United States [HPIPONM226S], retrieved from FRED, Federal
   Reserve Bank of St. Louis; https://fred.stlouisfed.org/series/HPIPONM226S,
   2026-10-08. FRED marks the series "Public Domain: Citation Requested".

4. Unemployment Rate
   File: apps/server/data/macro/UNRATE.csv
   Citation: U.S. Bureau of Labor Statistics, Unemployment Rate [UNRATE],
   retrieved from FRED, Federal Reserve Bank of St. Louis;
   https://fred.stlouisfed.org/series/UNRATE, 2026-10-08. FRED marks the
   series "Public Domain: Citation Requested".

5. FDIC BankFind Suite, institution financial data (Call Report)
   Used to tune the balance sheet mix of the synthetic Quillfield Bank
   (examples/mid-size-bank-v1.json), as docs/oss/mid-size-bank.md records.
   FDIC data is public U.S. government data. The query returned one row per
   institution (905 institutions), which were summed; only the sums are
   used, and no institution's figures are reproduced.

Third-party software

Dependencies are installed by npm from package.json and the package.json of
